[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_ENGINE_3B_ELEC]
Electric Generator Engine (Air)

[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_ENGINE_3B_ELEC_desc]
An electric generator can work in many ways, converting mechanical energy into electrical energy, converting thermal energy into electrical energy, converting magic into electrical energy, or more simply - feeding some flash bees.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_ENGINE_3B_ELEC]
电机引擎 (空)

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_ENGINE_3B_ELEC_desc]
发电机有很多种工作方式，机械能转化为电能，热能转化为电能，魔法转化为电能，或者更简单——饲养一些闪光蜂。
